Now {{irci|}} template automatically colorizes names of users by creating a 
pseudo-hash and making a color of certain hue out of it. It also means that 
the same color for the same user is preserved across all pages.
Example:
http://mw.lojban.org/lmw/jbocre:_Bear_goo

